      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": "import numpy as np\n\nX = np.array([[1, -2], [0, 1], [2, 3], [1, -1]])\nweights = np.array([1.0, -1.0])\nlearning_rate = 1\n\nfor x in X:\n    output = np.dot(weights, x)\n    weights = weights + learning_rate * output * x\n\nprint(\"Final Weights:\", weights)",
